WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.334
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.734
This is "Late Night".
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:05.734
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:08.801
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden
appeared last night

00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:09.934
at the Grammy Awards.

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:12.100
It was gonna be Joe,
but he's not trusted

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:13.734
with classified material.

00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:16.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:19.133
President Biden is set
tomorrow to deliver

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:20.767
his State of the Union address,

00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:23.834
and it's not a great sign
that the best he can say is,

00:00:23.834 --> 00:00:27.901
"The state of our union
is balloon-free."

00:00:27.901 --> 00:00:29.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.968 --> 00:00:31.934
President Biden told reporters
over the weekend

00:00:31.934 --> 00:00:34.267
that he ordered the military
to shoot down the suspected

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.834
Chinese spy balloon, which
must've been tough,

00:00:36.834 --> 00:00:39.901
'cause if anyone loves balloons,
it's this guy.

00:00:39.901 --> 00:00:42.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.934 --> 00:00:44.567
According to a new report
from Bloomberg News,

00:00:44.567 --> 00:00:46.400
New York Congressman
George Santos

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.501
once claimed to have been a
producer on the Broadway musical

00:00:49.501 --> 00:00:52.801
"Spider-Man: Turn off the Dark".

00:00:52.801 --> 00:00:55.400
Another obvious lie,
because if you saw that show,

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:57.968
you know it didn't have
producers.

00:00:57.968 --> 00:01:00.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:01.834
At an event at the White House
last week,

00:01:01.834 --> 00:01:03.667
celebrating
the 30th anniversary of the

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:05.100
Family and Medical Leave Act,

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:08.167
former President Bill Clinton
said that he has more people

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:09.667
bring up this law than, quote,

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:11.868
"any other specific thing
he did."

00:01:11.868 --> 00:01:13.067
Well, I don't know.

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:16.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.167 --> 00:01:18.367
I feel like it's the second.

00:01:18.367 --> 00:01:19.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:22.133
That's like OJ saying
most people bring up

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:23.567
his Hertz commercials.

00:01:23.567 --> 00:01:26.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.334 --> 00:01:28.734
Authorities in Canada are
searching for two suspects

00:01:28.734 --> 00:01:30.501
who were seen driving
a stolen car

00:01:30.501 --> 00:01:31.734
through a shopping mall.

00:01:31.734 --> 00:01:33.033
Whoa!

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:35.167
If it was the '90s,
they could've killed someone.

00:01:35.167 --> 00:01:40.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:44.334
It's such a fancy
abandoned mall.

00:01:44.334 --> 00:01:46.167
According to a new study,
Florida, last year,

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:48.300
experienced more lightning
strikes than any other state,

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:50.968
which might mean that even God
is getting tired of waiting

00:01:50.968 --> 00:01:52.267
for Merrick Garland.

00:01:52.267 --> 00:01:54.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.534 --> 00:01:56.534
The Rock &amp; Roll Hall of Fame has
announced this year's

00:01:56.534 --> 00:01:57.567
class of nominees.

00:01:57.567 --> 00:01:59.400
It's the one hall of fame
that understands

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.467
that performance-enhancing drugs
are just part of the game.

00:02:02.467 --> 00:02:04.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.434
A federal judge in Oklahoma
recently ruled

00:02:06.434 --> 00:02:09.367
that a law prohibiting marijuana
users from owning guns

00:02:09.367 --> 00:02:10.767
is unconstitutional.

00:02:10.767 --> 00:02:12.868
It makes sense, because by
the time they find their gun,

00:02:12.868 --> 00:02:14.534
they forgot what
they were mad about.

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:16.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.734 --> 00:02:26.267
Producers have released
a trailer for a new reality show

00:02:26.267 --> 00:02:28.734
about actor Sylvester Stallone
and his family.

00:02:28.734 --> 00:02:32.000
And, yeah, you're probably gonna
need the captions on.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:35.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.234 --> 00:02:38.834
A man in Cambodia recently
built a home

00:02:38.834 --> 00:02:41.000
modeled after an airplane,
and now he's finally

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.234
ready to sit back, relax,
and recline his armchair

00:02:44.234 --> 00:02:46.801
three inches.

00:02:46.801 --> 00:02:48.501
And finally, in honor
of Valentine's Day,

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:50.534
the restaurant chain
Cracker Barrel has launched

00:02:50.534 --> 00:02:53.501
a new contest that'll give five
couples free food for a year

00:02:53.501 --> 00:02:55.167
if they get engaged
at the restaurant.

00:02:55.167 --> 00:02:57.567
Also, doing a promotion
for newly engaged couples

00:02:57.567 --> 00:02:58.667
at Cracker Barrel --

00:02:58.667 --> 00:02:59.901
divorce attorneys.

00:02:59.901 --> 00:03:01.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.501 --> 00:03:04.133
Bless your heart, but take
a card just in case.

00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:06.133
That was a monologue, everybody.

